./ R 51700000          $ 51700100 100                                           
*  SHRPAGE IS AN STE IN ALL BUT NAME -- SHRTABLE.COPY SAYS SO  XA0036DK         
*  IN A COMMENT AND NO SYMBOL JOINS THEM -- SO ITS LENGTH      XA0036DK         
*  FIELD MOVES WITH THE STE'S: PTL IS THE LOW NIBBLE AND       XA0036DK         
*  COUNTS 16 ENTRIES AT A TIME.                                XA0036DK         
         N     R9,=A(SEGPTLF) LEAVE ONLY PTL                   XA0036DK         
         LA    R9,1(,R9)      UNITS OF 16 ENTRIES              XA0036DK         
         SLL   R9,4           NUMBER OF PAGES                  XA0036DK         
         BCTR  R9,0           MINUS ONE, AS BEFORE             XA0036DK         
./ R 52200000          $ 52200100 100                                           
         LA    R8,PAGPFRA     POINTER TO 1ST PAGE ADDRESS      XA0036DK         
./ R 52400000          $ 52400100 100                                           
         USING PAGPFRA,R8                                      XA0036DK         
./ R 53800000          $ 53800100 100                                           
         TM    PAGPFRA+2,PAGINV IS PAGE IN CORE?               XA0036DK         
./ R 54000000 54100000 $ 54000100 100                                           
*  THE S/370 PTE VALUE WAS ALSO THE CORTABLE OFFSET: A FRAME   XA0036DK         
*  NUMBER TIMES 16 IS BOTH, SO ONE MASK SERVED TWO PURPOSES.   XA0036DK         
*  AN ESA/390 PTE IS THE FRAME'S REAL ADDRESS, SO THE INDEX    XA0036DK         
*  NEEDS AN SRL 8. NOTHING REPORTS THIS: A R2,ACORETBL NAMES   XA0036DK         
*  NO DAT FIELD.                                               XA0036DK         
         L     R2,PAGPFRA     LOAD A PAGE TABLE ENTRY          XA0036DK         
         N     R2,=A(PAGPFRM) LEAVE ONLY THE FRAME ADDRESS     XA0036DK         
         SRL   R2,8           A CORTABLE ENTRY IS 16 A PAGE    XA0036DK         
./ R 57400000          $ 57400100 100                                           
         MVC   PAGPFRA,=A(PAGINVW) INVALIDATE PAGE TABLE       XA0036DK         
./ R 62000000          $ 62000100 100                                           
         LA    R8,L'PAGPFRA(,R8) ADDRESS THE NEXT ENTRY        XA0036DK         
